00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:10.477 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Zubin Mehta est une légende

00:00:07.141 --> 00:00:11.712 size:53% position:73% line:53%
bien vivante de la musique

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:12.913 size:53% position:73% line:53%
classique. De passage à la

00:00:11.645 --> 00:00:14.148 size:53% position:73% line:53%
souvient

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:34.268 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que pour a commencé

00:00:13.247 --> 00:00:34.268 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'Orchestre symphonique

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:34.268 size:53% position:73% line:53%
