00:00:35.436 --> 00:00:41.208 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:42.409 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Né à Bombay, en Inde, d'un

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.644 size:53% position:73% line:53%
père vest devenu le directeur ml

00:00:41.542 --> 00:00:47.181 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'OSM en 1961. Il avait

00:00:42.743 --> 00:00:49.216 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à peine 24 ans. En 1963,

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:53.253 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il a participé à l'inauguration

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:54.755 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Wilfrid-Pelletier de la

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:56.490 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Place-des-arts et il a dirigé

00:00:53.587 --> 00:00:56.490 size:53% position:73% line:53%
