00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.874 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La carvolée après son départ

00:01:11.505 --> 00:01:16.910 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Montréal en 1967. Il a dirigé

00:01:12.706 --> 00:01:18.445 size:53% position:73% line:53%
entre autres l'orchestre

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:19.947 size:53% position:73% line:53%
philarmonique de Los Angeles

00:01:17.244 --> 00:01:23.016 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de New York jusqu'en 1991.

00:01:18.779 --> 00:01:24.518 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et pendant cinquante ans,

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:28.989 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il a donné 4000 concertsueueueue

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:28.989 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'Israël dont un premier concert

00:01:24.852 --> 00:01:28.989 size:53% position:73% line:53%
