00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:46.306 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:01:43.604 --> 00:01:47.541 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- De passage à Montréal pour

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:48.776 size:53% position:73% line:53%
