00:01:46.640 --> 00:02:04.391 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avec l'OSM, à 85 ans, Zubin

00:01:47.874 --> 00:02:05.592 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mehta est encore lser

00:01:49.109 --> 00:02:06.827 size:53% position:73% line:53%
